    "text": "Formal equivalence — \"word for word.\" Follows the Greek and Hebrew sentence structure as closely as English allows. Preserves ambiguity, including ambiguity the translators find awkward. Reads stiffly.\n→ NASB, ESV, RSV, NRSV, KJV, NKJV, LSB",
    "raw_text": "**Formal equivalence** — \"word for word.\" Follows the Greek and Hebrew sentence structure as closely as English allows. Preserves ambiguity, including ambiguity the translators find awkward. Reads stiffly.\n→ NASB, ESV, RSV, NRSV, KJV, NKJV, LSB",
