    "id": "rk_ccc4d3360b9357fdc9bf",
    "text": "Romans 16:7 — Junia. \"Well known to the apostles\" (ESV) vs. \"prominent among the apostles\" (NRSV). One preposition decides whether a woman was an apostle. Also worth knowing: for centuries the name was printed as the masculine \"Junias,\" a man who appears nowhere else in Greek literature. Modern editions have restored Junia.",
    "raw_text": "**Romans 16:7 — Junia.** \"Well known *to* the apostles\" (ESV) vs. \"prominent *among* the apostles\" (NRSV). One preposition decides whether a woman was an apostle. Also worth knowing: for centuries the name was printed as the masculine \"Junias,\" a man who appears nowhere else in Greek literature. Modern editions have restored Junia.",
